Hi!

I back-ported this change to 10.0.x stable/lts series, - this version
lacks a few changes which are in older releases, such as merging of
various _i32 & _i64 operands, also 03329e3ce460 "tcg/optimize: Build and
use o_bits in fold_shift" is missing.  And previous change in this area,
77ad6491326b4d "tcg/optimize: Fix s_mask computation for shifts", also
had to be adjusted for 10.0.x.

Please take a (quick?) look at the two commits at
https://gitlab.com/mjt0k/qemu/-/commits/71ceb9311bf43afa6da0f46677755d29e4646fb5
which are this commit d228536a5142cd and the test, - whenever everything
looks correct for 10.0.x

